  title: 'Mail cache: index'
  body: "DELAYED MAIL: 11 MONTHS\n\nFERREIRA  41 messages  (most from 'M\xE3e', all marked urgent, none urgent)\nMORI  12 messages  (sister: wedding photos, a pressed flower scanned flat)\nLINDQVIST  2 messages  (agency HR; one unread from T. Brandt, addressed to OKAFOR)\nASHFORD  1 message  (agency, encrypted, COMMAND ONLY)\nOKAFOR  63 messages  (Ada; Zara: 'drawings, lots, sorry not sorry')"
  setsFlag: 
